---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Emon Hossain | AI Systems Strategist & Automation Builder | Bangladesh"
  description="Emon Hossain builds, tests and explains practical AI systems, automation and real-world workflows from Bangladesh. Explore his work, writing and research."
  ogTitle="Emon Hossain — Practical AI Systems, Automation & Business"
>
  <section class="container hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">AI SYSTEMS · AUTOMATION · BUSINESS</div>
    <h1>I build practical AI systems for <span class="gradient-text">real work.</span></h1>
    <p>I design, test and explain AI-powered workflows that help businesses and creators automate repetitive work, improve operations and use AI more effectively — built from Bangladesh, useful anywhere.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="/about" class="btn-primary">View My Work</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-outline">Work With Me</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <div class="eyebrow">WHAT I WORK ON</div>
      <h2>Systems first. Tools second.</h2>
      <p>The focus is practical implementation, original testing and clear explanation — not AI hype or tool collecting.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-4">
      <a href="/sysmoai" class="entity-card">
        <div class="icon brand-gradient">S</div>
        <div class="role">BUILD</div>
        <h3>AI Systems & Automation</h3>
        <p>Workflow design, operating systems and automation built around a real process and a clear handoff.</p>
        <div class="arrow">Explore systems →</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/writing" class="entity-card">
        <div class="icon brand-gradient">T</div>
        <div class="role">TEST</div>
        <h3>AI Tools in Real Workflows</h3>
        <p>Practical tests of AI tools and methods, including limitations, implementation trade-offs and lessons from use.</p>
        <div class="arrow">Read notes →</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/bangladeshai" class="entity-card">
        <div class="icon brand-gradient">R</div>
        <div class="role">RESEARCH</div>
        <h3>AI Adoption & Bangladesh</h3>
        <p>Independent research and public-interest work on AI adoption, governance and emerging-market realities.</p>
        <div class="arrow">Explore research →</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/about" class="entity-card">
        <div class="icon brand-gradient">E</div>
        <div class="role">EXPLAIN</div>
        <h3>Practical AI Education</h3>
        <p>Clear Bangla- and English-friendly explanations for creators, operators and businesses learning how to apply AI.</p>
        <div class="arrow">About Emon →</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section data-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-title">
        <div class="eyebrow">PROOF OVER HYPE</div>
        <h2 style="color:white;">What earns a place here</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--brand-steel);">Strong claims are published only when the underlying work can be shown, sourced or independently checked.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="data-grid">
        <div class="data-item">
          <div class="num">Real builds</div>
          <div class="label">Systems, workflows, screenshots and implementation lessons.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="data-item">
          <div class="num">Original testing</div>
          <div class="label">What worked, what failed, what it cost and where the limits are.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="data-item">
          <div class="num">Citable research</div>
          <div class="label">Research is separated from commercial claims and linked to its sources.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <div class="eyebrow">WORK & RESEARCH</div>
      <h2>Different roles, one public identity.</h2>
      <p>Commercial implementation, personal publishing and public-interest research stay clearly separated so each claim has the right context.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <a href="/sysmoai" class="entity-card">
        <div class="role">COMMERCIAL AI SYSTEMS</div>
        <h3>SYSmoAI</h3>
        <p>Commercial systems and automation work. Scope, delivery terms and pricing are confirmed per engagement rather than implied by old public price cards.</p>
        <div class="arrow">Learn more →</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/bangladeshai" class="entity-card">
        <div class="role">RESEARCH / PUBLIC INTEREST</div>
        <h3>BangladeshAI.Org</h3>
        <p>Bangladesh-focused AI research and public-interest work. It is not used as Emon's formal academic affiliation or as a commercial sales funnel.</p>
        <div class="arrow">Learn more →</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container" id="contact">
    <div class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:0;">
      <div class="eyebrow">CONTACT</div>
      <h2>Have a relevant project, collaboration or interview?</h2>
      <p>Use the contact page for business, creator, speaking, research or media inquiries.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Contact Emon</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
